    callr,
    commonmark,
    ellmer (>= 0.5.0),
    htmltools,
    httpuv,
    jsonlite,
    keyring (>= 1.3.0),
    knitr,
    later,
    remotes,
    rlang,
    rstudioapi,
    shiny (>= 1.14.0)
Suggests:
    httr2,
    pdftools
URL: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant
BugReports: https://github.com/MySimpleSmart/RAssistant/issues
Config/RAssistant/Changes: Follow literal source()/sys.source() imports and Rmd child references on Send with Workspace On, including nested project files and source(chdir=TRUE). Parse paths without executing project code; label dynamic, missing and excluded references.
    Map function calls to candidate definitions by file and global line number. Send fresh related code, using complete relevant function excerpts when a module exceeds the shared excerpt budget; keep duplicate definitions and runtime bindings unverified.
    Bound dependency traversal to three levels and six files, with cycle, file-size and shared excerpt limits. Keep the active unsaved editor authoritative and related files read-only; Workspace Off excludes the scan.
